&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 ds-type-heading-five&quot;&gt;Your mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;Your mission is to work hands-on with the parts of the aircraft that turn stored energy into flight: the&lt;br&gt;motors, the batteries, and the propulsion and power components that decide how far, how fast, and how&lt;br&gt;long our platforms fly. You support the hardware team from bench characterisation through data analysis&lt;br&gt;in MATLAB and Python.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You aren&#39;t just swapping components on a bench; you are helping generate the measured evidence that&lt;br&gt;decides what actually flies — and learning how unmanned hardware is designed, tested, and pushed to its&lt;br&gt;limits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
