&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support characterisation and bench testing of motors, propellers, batteries, and power components for our UAS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help set up test rigs and instrumentation, and capture clean, repeatable measurement data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with component selection and trade-offs by turning test data into clear comparisons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce and analyse test data in MATLAB and Python — efficiency, thrust, endurance, thermal and discharge behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visualise results so the engineering team can make decisions from them quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep test setups, measurements, and findings documented and traceable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
